**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/checkout/city_state" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9e188d66d77f64019a05ae05ac80010039ccbebb1df9b9019a05ae05ac800100" \
  -d $'{
    "merchant_id": "DEMO",
    "cart_id": "25787516233C82019A17A39E9B800100",
    "currency_code": "USD",
    "base_currency_code": "USD",
    "shipping": {
        "postal_code": "44233"
    }
}'
```

**Response Headers**
```html
Status: 200 OK
X-UltraCart-Request-Id: 132D5D69FBC5BA019A17A3A0E480011
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Date: Fri, 24 Oct 2025 19:13:11 GMT
```

**Response Body**
```json
{
    "city": "HINCKLEY",
    "state": "OH",
    "zip": "44233",
    "validZip": true
}
```
